  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="41">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 41</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Nu wille we eac læran Godes þeowas georne, þæt hy huru hy sylfe wærlice beþencan ⁊ þurh Godes fultum clænnesse lufian ⁊ georne heora bocum ⁊ gebedum fylgean ⁊ dæges ⁊ nihtes oft ⁊ gelome clypian to Christe ⁊ for eal Christen folc þingian georne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Now we desire likewise earnestly to enjoin upon the servants of God, that above all they carefully take thought for themselves, and by God's help practise celibacy, and diligently apply themselves to their books and prayers and day and night frequently and often call upon Christ, and zealously intercede for all Christian people.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[Not in D]</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
